# The Guild embeds third-party submissions, so it is worth being explicit about
# what this origin will and will not do.
#
# `frame-src` allows the apps origin plus any https: host, because `play.url` is
# a documented way to submit — a work hosted elsewhere and embedded here. Pinning
# this to the apps origin alone silently broke that path: the frame was refused
# and the page showed an empty box with nothing in the console to explain it.
# Allowing https: still refuses the schemes that actually matter, `javascript:`
# and `data:`, which is where an iframe src can escape into this origin.
#
# `frame-ancestors 'none'` is the mirror of frame-src — the Guild itself is never
# to be embedded in someone else's page.
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-src https: https://vibe-guild-apps.moneytalkwithmalik.workers.dev; frame-ancestors 'none'; base-uri 'none'; object-src 'none'
